# Design system

Tokens live in `src/styles/tokens.css`. Use CSS variables — do not hardcode one-off palette values in components.

## Direction

- **Notion-flat:** solid surfaces, hairline borders, no gradients, no glows, no jade/purple “AI” looks
- Light: `#ffffff` / `#f7f6f3` · Dark: `#191919` / `#202020` via `html[data-theme]`
- Accent: Notion blue `#2383e2`
- UI type: Inter · Letter prose (`.prose`): Source Serif 4 / Georgia
- Icons: Lucide-style stroke icons (see `ThemeToggle`)
- Motion: progress bar only; do not reintroduce entrance stagger/rise

## Theme

- FOUC script in `BaseLayout` sets `data-theme` from `localStorage.theme` or `prefers-color-scheme`
- `ThemeToggle` in `SiteHeader` flips light ↔ dark and persists
- Update `meta theme-color` when theme changes (`#ffffff` / `#191919`)

## Composition

- Home first viewport: brand (logo + Leonardo Sforza) + one line + CTA group only
- No cards in the hero; list cards stay flat (border + hover fill), not elevated shadows
- Avoid: gradients, frosted blur headers, pill-glow buttons, Fraunces/display-serif chrome

## Brand

Logo slot: `public/brand/logo.svg`. Keep header brand name visible; do not demote the name to tiny nav-only text on marketing surfaces.
